  "dock": "A busy 1848 San Francisco harbour wharf: wooden pier planks, crates and barrels piled high, tall wooden sailing ships behind, gulls, sunny sky",
  "street": "A muddy 1848 San Francisco main street: wooden storefronts and canvas tents on both sides, green hills behind, bright morning sky",
