  "lawyer": "An 1870s lawyer's office: tall bookshelves full of law books, a big wooden desk piled with papers, a tall window, dark wooden floor",
  "lot": "An empty, weedy land lot in 1880s California: dry grass and dirt, a broken fence, a falling-down shack, grey cloudy sky",
